so no licence was ever actually published here.


1. THE SITE'S OWN CONTENT
-------------------------

The original material in this repository — the guide and tutorial text, the
page structure, the stylesheet, the scripts, and the site design — may not be
copied, redistributed, republished, or hosted elsewhere without the written
permission of the copyright holder.

You may:

  - View the site and read its content.
  - Save pages locally for your own personal, offline reading.
  - Quote short passages with attribution and a link back to the source.
  - Fork this repository on GitHub for the purpose of preparing a contribution
    back to it via pull request.

You may not:

  - Republish this site, in whole or in substantial part, at another address.
  - Present this content as your own work.
  - Redistribute it as part of another project or product.


