5. A NOTE ON WHAT A LICENCE CAN AND CANNOT DO
---------------------------------------------

This licence does not, and cannot, make the site technically impossible to
copy. Any page a browser can display has already been downloaded in full to
the visitor's machine. What this licence does is establish who owns the
original work, which is what makes a takedown request or a claim of
infringement possible. Attribution and provenance are the realistic
protections; obstruction is not one.
